xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xccheckout
*.xcscmblueprint
*.moved-aside
*.hmap

# Xcode build products and derived data
DerivedData/
build/
Build/
*.o
*.a
*.ipa
*.xcarchive
*.dSYM
